{"sha": "5351a895a7181986155c76e50cc6863cbb2f9965e438ef2820f2a8b74feacf16", "body": ["\\begin{method}[计算万有引力]\\label{met:g10:universal-gravitation:compute}", "\\begin{enumerate}", "  \\item 将质量换算为千克，将两中心", "        之间的距离换算为米。", "  \\item 应用 $F = G m_1 m_2 / d^2$。", "  \\item 将 10 的幂与数字部分分开检查，", "        如\\cref{ch:g10:orders-of-magnitude}所示，万有引力的取值范围", "        从 $\\num{e-7}$ 牛顿（两人相距一米）到 $\\num{e22}$ 牛顿", "        （太阳对地球），因此指数写错很容易发现。", "\\end{enumerate}", "\\end{method}", "", "\\section{重力与重力加速度}", "", "\\begin{definition}[重力]\\label{def:g10:universal-gravitation:weight}", "\\emph{重力}\\index{重力} $\\vect P$ 是物体在恒星", "（行星、卫星等）表面所受恒星施加的万有引力。", "其方向指向恒星中心，也就是我们所称的", "\\emph{竖直方向}\\index{竖直方向}的方向，单位为牛顿。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{proposition}[恒星表面的重力]\\label{prop:g10:universal-gravitation:surfaceg}", "质量为 $M$、半径为 $R$ 的球形恒星表面，", "质量为 $m$ 的物体所受重力为", "\\[", "P = m\\,g,", "\\qquad\\text{其中}\\qquad", "g = \\frac{G M}{R^2}", "\\]", "仅取决于恒星，与物体无关。", "\\end{proposition}", "", "\\begin{proof}", "物体中心与恒星中心相距 $R$，因此", "由万有引力定律", "（\\cref{thm:g10:universal-gravitation:law}）可得", "$P = G M m / R^2 = m \\times \\left(G M / R^2\\right)$。括号内的量", "对表面上的每个物体都相同，记为 $g$。", "\\end{proof}", "", "\\begin{definition}[重力加速度]\\label{def:g10:universal-gravitation:fieldstrength}", "量 $g = G M / R^2$，单位为牛顿每千克，是", "恒星表面的\\emph{重力加速度}\\index{重力加速度}：", "即恒星对每千克物质的引力为 $g$ 牛顿。", "在地球上，$g = \\qty{9.81}{N/kg}$。", "\\end{definition}", "", "\\begin{example}[计算 $g$]\\label{ex:g10:universal-gravitation:gvalues}", "对地球（$M = \\qty{5.97e24}{kg}$，$R = \\qty{6.37e6}{m}$）：", "\\[", "g = \\frac{\\num{6.67e-11} \\times \\num{5.97e24}}{(\\num{6.37e6})^2}", "= \\frac{\\num{3.98e14}}{\\num{4.06e13}}", "\\approx \\qty{9.81}{N/kg}.", "\\]", "对月球（$M = \\qty{7.35e22}{kg}$，$R = \\qty{1.74e6}{m}$），同样计算", "得 $g_{\\text{月球}} \\approx \\qty{1.62}{N/kg}$，约为地球的六分之一：", "月球的质量小得多，半径较小也无法弥补这一差距。", "对火星，$g_{\\text{火星}} \\approx \\qty{3.73}{N/kg}$。", "\\end{example}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}", "\\begin{axis}[omaxis, axis x line=bottom, axis y line=left,", "  width=8.8cm, height=5.4cm, ybar, bar width=15pt,", "  symbolic x coords={Moon, Mars, Earth, Jupiter}, xtick=data,", "  ylabel={$g$ (\\unit{N/kg})}, ymin=0, ymax=29,", "  nodes near coords,", "  every node near coord/.append style={font=\\small},", "  enlarge x limits=0.16]", "\\addplot[draw=omDef, fill=omDef!25] coordinates", "  {(Moon,1.62) (Mars,3.73) (Earth,9.81) (Jupiter,24.8)};", "\\end{axis}", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small 四个天体表面的重力加速度：同样的", "\\qty{1}{kg} 糖袋在月球上的重力为 \\qty{1.6}{N}，", "在木星上则为 \\qty{25}{N}。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{omfigure}", "\\begin{tikzpicture}[scale=1.0]", "  \\fill[omExo!15] (0,0) circle (1.5);", "  \\draw[omExo, thick] (0,0) circle (1.5);", "  \\fill (0,0) circle (1.5pt) node[below, font=\\small] {$O$};", "  \\fill (90:1.5) circle (1.8pt) node[above, font=\\small] {$A$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (90:1.5) -- (90:0.8)", "    node[pos=0.6, right, font=\\small] {$\\vect P_A$};", "  \\fill (200:1.5) circle (1.8pt) node[left, font=\\small] {$B$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (200:1.5) -- (200:0.8)", "    node[pos=0.6, below, font=\\small] {$\\vect P_B$};", "  \\fill (330:1.5) circle (1.8pt) node[right, font=\\small] {$C$};", "  \\draw[-Stealth, omThm, thick] (330:1.5) -- (330:0.8)", "    node[pos=0.6, above left, font=\\small] {$\\vect P_C$};", "\\end{tikzpicture}", "", "{\\small “向下”是一个局部概念：在地球的每一点，", "重力矢量都指向球心 $O$。对跖点上的两位行人", "都直立站立，脚朝向彼此。}", "\\end{omfigure}", "", "\\begin{remark}[宇航员为何会蹦跳]\\label{rem:g10:universal-gravitation:bounce}", "一名质量为 \\qty{120}{kg}（连同宇航服）的宇航员在地球上的重力为", "$120 \\times 9.81 \\approx \\qty{1180}{N}$，而在月球上仅为", "$120 \\times 1.62 \\approx \\qty{194}{N}$。习惯于", "\\qty{1180}{N} 负荷的肌肉突然只需承担六分之一的负载，因此", "形成了著名的缓慢蹦跳式月面步态。质量——以及随之而来的", "\\emph{停止}或\\emph{转向}所需的努力——都没有改变，这正是", "月球宇航员频频摔倒的原因。", "\\end{remark}", ""]}